---
// The home page: a title, a short welcome text and a link to the contact form.
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Welcome | contact-form-check-2</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>Welcome to contact-form-check-2</h1>
      <p>
        This is a simple website where you can get in touch with us. Use the contact form to send us
        a message and we will read it.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="/contact">
        Contact
      </a>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #1a1a1a;
    background: #f6f7f9;
  }
  main {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    max-width: 40rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 6vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    background: #1d4ed8;
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .button:hover,
  .button:focus-visible {
    background: #1e3a8a;
  }
</style>
